  "id": "ten-unpardonable-sins-detailed-breakdown",
  "name": "Ten Unpardonable Sins Detailed Breakdown",
  "sourceUrl": "https://honkai-star-rail.fandom.com/wiki/Ten_Unpardonable_Sins_Detailed_Breakdown",
  "scrapedAt": "2026-08-02T09:05:40.465Z",
  "volumes": [
    {
      "id": "1",
      "volumeKey": "text",
      "label": "Text",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "* This brochure on Xianzhou laws continuously re-instates the legal interpretation of the Ten Unpardonable Sins. Perpetrators who commit these sins will face the most severe penalties.*"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-cab666b9dc4251c6"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The first sin is \"Involuntary Immortalization.\""
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "It refers to the crime of contaminating the genetic makeup of short-life species, resulting in their transformation into long-life species, then eventually degenerate into abominations."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-353c502ed0935fde"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The second sin is \"Immortality Theft.\""
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "It refers to the crime committed by travelers who infiltrate the Xianzhou with the intent to steal the secret of immortality."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-7fdda104e024a784"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The third sin is \"Beguilement.\""
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "It refers to the crime of foreign races with abilities to manipulate minds, who use this to deprive individuals of their free will and control them."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-6e32c6606fe596b0"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The fourth sin is \"Mara Ensnarement.\""
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "It refers to the crime of inducing mara-struck through specific means."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-33f287b1636e9afc"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The fifth sin is \"Phratry Murder.\""
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "It refers to the crime of violently taking the lives of fellow Xianzhou peoples."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-e240bbc89e99bdd9"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The sixth sin is \"Illicit Espionage.\""
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "It refers to the crime of the theft of confidential information from the governmental organizations of the Xianzhou."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-af70d52565bba413"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The seventh sin is \"Prison Break.\""
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "It refers to the crime of attempting to breach the confinement of the Ten-Lords Division, and attempting to enter The Shackling Prison to release prisoners held within."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-5820677e1b127f4b"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The eighth sin is \"Sowing Discord.\""
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "It refers to the crime of inciting, dividing, or undermining unity among the various races on the Xianzhou."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-7f3f9559342291b4"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The ninth sin is \"Incitement to Riot.\""
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "It refers to the crime of mobilizing military forces to launch an attack on the Xianzhou, inciting war or rebellion."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-a8baed08bd034011"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The tenth sin is \"Capsizing Xianzhou.\""
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "It refers to the crime of attempting to disintegrate the physical structure of the Xianzhou ships with the aim of it sinking."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-868f383f54ff4297"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
